tinacloud-completion(1) -- Generate shell completion scripts
============================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud completion` <shell>

## DESCRIPTION

Generate a completion script for a supported shell. Follow the selected
shell's instructions to enable completions for the current session or future
sessions.

## COMMANDS

  * `bash`:
    Generate a Bash completion script.

  * `zsh`:
    Generate a Zsh completion script.

  * `fish`:
    Generate a Fish completion script.

  * `powershell`:
    Generate a PowerShell completion script.

## EXAMPLES

Enable Bash completions for the current session:

	$ source <(tinacloud completion bash)

Install Fish completions:

	$ tinacloud completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/tinacloud.fish

